  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core funding for International Planned Parenthood Federation - 2024/25 - 2026/27</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This multi-year core funding provides financial certainty and enables better forecasting and delivery of International Planned Parenthood Federation&apos;s (IPPF)&#xA0;Strategic Plan 2023-2028. IPPF leads a locally owned, globally connected civil society movement that provides and enables services and champions sexual and reproductive health and rights for all, especially the under-served.</narrative>
  </description>
